  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n<b>Monterey Jack</b> is a game where you’re trapped in a cheese factory. Your best friend is missing. And a giant cheese man wants you dead. <p></p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li><b>WILLY WONKA MEETS HELL</b> – Drip, drop, the dairy’s near, Monterey Jack is what you fear! <b>Monterey Jack</b> hunts you in real-time. Stay alert, watch your noise meter and follow his cheesy footprints, or risk getting caught off guard.\n</li><li><b>WHO CUT THE CHEESE?</b> – Jack is not alone. His army of cheese zombies must be chopped into bits!\n</li><li><b>OUTRUN, OUTSMART, AND SURVIVE</b> – Enemies have detailed hitboxes, requiring players to find weak spots. Use <b>makeshift weapons</b> such as <b>slingshots, nail guns, and kitchen knives</b> to fight a large cast of cheese-born baddies. Enemies react based on where they are hit.\n</li><li><b>EXPLORE THE MASSIVE CHEESE FACTORY</b> – Travel the cheese river to explore the cheese factory. <b>Monterey Jack</b> is packed with <b>terrifying encounters, intense chases, and heart-stopping jump scares</b>. The game features <b>multiple endings</b>, and a <b>survival mode</b>: where players have to run from Jack for as long as they can, with their time going up on a Steam <b>leaderboard</b>.\n</li></ul>\n",
